konsole dolphin ark kate okular gwenview spectacle kcalc
firefox-esr firefox-esr-l10n-es-es
plasma-discover plasma-discover-backend-flatpak flatpak
breeze-gtk-theme kde-config-gtk-style xdg-desktop-portal-kde
